              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "прекращаться (prekrashchátsya) is built on пре- and кратить \"to shorten\", from краткий \"short\", usually explained as the Church Slavonic shape of native короткий, Proto-Slavic kortŭkŭ (EtymDB): to cut short."
